{"study_accession":"PRJNA1130831","secondary_study_accession":"SRP517470","title":"Gene expression analysis in obsessive-compulsive disorder with and without comorbid neurodevelopmental disorders","description":"Obsessive-compulsive disorder (OCD) is an intractable disease with a prevalence of 2-3%. Despite treatment with antidepressants, its pathogenesis remains unclear. Recent research suggests immunological mechanisms, particularly in OCD comorbid with neurodevelopmental disorders (NDD) like ASD, ADHD, and TD. This study investigates immune factors involved in OCD and its comorbidities. To reveal the mechanism, RNA-Seq was performed. Overall design: Twenty-eight OCD patients were assessed, including 14 with NDD comorbidities. RNA was extracted from blood samples and analyzed using RNA sequencing (RNA-Seq).","pubmed":"40036942","geo_series":"","n_samples":28,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN42226434","study_accession":"PRJNA1130831","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"OCD with NDD patients 14","description":"OCD with NDD patients 14","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM8372535","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-04-19","attributes":[["source_name","whole blood"],["tissue","whole blood"],["disease","OCD with NDD"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR29675726","experiment_accession":"SRX25179182","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":35324675,"base_count":10597402500,"first_public":"2026-04-19","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM8372535: OCD with NDD patients 14 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN42226435","study_accession":"PRJNA1130831","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"OCD with NDD patients 13","description":"OCD with NDD patients 13","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM8372534","access":"open","dbgap":"